Schubert multiplication
-----------------------

To compile this program, do the following:

1) Get lrcalc-1.1.4.tar.gz from my web site
   http://math.rutgers.edu/~asbuch/lrcalc/ 

2) Unpack them with "tar xvf lrcalc-1.1.4.tar" and "tar xvf schmult.tar.gz"

3) cd lrcalc

4) ./configure

5) cd schubert

6) make

With luck, and if you are on a reasonably standard unix system, this will
produce a program called schubmult.

Example:

% ./schubmult 1 3 2 - 1 3 2
1  (1, 4, 2, 3)
1  (2, 3, 1)

Have fun!

Anders Buch


